<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Protection Paladin Tank - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41380/austere-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Austere Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40129/sovereign-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sovereign Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40119/solid-majestic-zircon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_42.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solid Majestic Zircon</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40167/enduring-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enduring Eye of Zul</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40166/vivid-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vivid Eye of Zul</span></a></div></li></ul>Primarily try to match <span class="gem2">red</span> and <span class="gem4">yellow</span> sockets when the bonus matches/<wbr/>exceeds +6 stamina or when it is crucial to do so for crit immunity or hit cap reasons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Protection Paladin Tank - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Shoulder - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44957/greater-inscription-of-the-gladiator">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of the Gladiator</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Back - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47672/enchant-cloak-mighty-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Mighty Armor</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Chest - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60692/enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Wrist - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62256/enchant-bracers-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Major Stamina</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hands - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reticulated Armor Webbing</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Legs - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38373/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Feet - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Main-Hand Weapon - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59619/enchant-weapon-accuracy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Accuracy</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Off-Hand Weapon - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44936/titanium-plating">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Titanium Plating</span></a></div></li></ul>Main stand out enchants here are your chest, cloak, and shield defense enchants which may be used at any point to bridge your early gearing defense gaps. Chest and cloak both provide roughly the same value in stats to their alternative counterparts making these highly efficient and you do not lose anything by enchanting defense. Your shield should preferably stay enhanced with block value. Likewise you have weapon enchant alternatives, Accuracy provides you with a base of stats that are relatively hard to replace, though you should look to re-enchant your weapon if you ever exceed your hit cap by more than 10 rating. We recommend <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46348/formula-enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulaepic_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Formula: Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=22559/formula-enchant-weapon-mongoose">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Formula: Enchant Weapon - Mongoose</span></a> at that point.</div>